.TH QUIPU-ALIGN-APPLY 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-align\-apply \- Materialize decided alignments into a derived alignment graph
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu align apply\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\-a\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\-b\fR] [\fB\-\-expected\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-actor\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIset.tsv\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Materialize decided alignments into a derived alignment graph
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\-a\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-graph\-b\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-expected\-version\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-actor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIset.tsv\fR>

